OL,3,GNEWSADragon flags spark row over
OL,4,A'far-right' links
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has criticised the local
OL,7,Fauthority his own party runs for not
OL,8,Fremoving flags which he and others
OL,9,Fclaim have links to white nationalism.
OL,11,FReform UK councillor Adrian Schulman
OL,12,Fsaid five flags depicting a white
OL,13,Fdragon on a red background were hung up
OL,14,Fin Crook in September.
OL,16,FHe said the insignia had links to a
OL,17,Fgroup that glorified Hitler and should
OL,18,Fnot be on display, but Reform-led
OL,19,FDurham County Council said it was
OL,20,Ftaking a "common sense" approach to
OL,21,Fflags.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
