OL,3,GNEWSADragon flags spark row over
OL,4,A'far-right' links
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtremism expert Dr William Allchorn
OL,7,Fsaid the white dragon was a recognised
OL,8,Fsymbol within sections of the British
OL,9,Ffar right, but Prof Paul Jackson said
OL,10,Fthe imagery could also relate to
OL,11,FEnglish mythology.
